{"5019070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dusky's Nook", "steam_appid": 5019070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dusky's Nook is a cozy idle desktop game about a little mushroom guy living his life on a floating island.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gather mushrooms</u></strong><br>Dusky spends his days foraging on his own. Rare glowing mushrooms appear now and then — those ones only you can collect, for a big EXP boost.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/86f6d4e393fce34c9d85e74a150df7de.poster.avif?t=1787090035\" width=556 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/86f6d4e393fce34c9d85e74a150df7de.webm?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/86f6d4e393fce34c9d85e74a150df7de.mp4?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Make the island yours</u></strong><br>Level up to unlock new looks for Dusky and his island, light phases, the palette, the music, a few extra animations, and maybe even some new companions..</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/7656de428e8f31443f5e70bc70b45da1.poster.avif?t=1787090035\" width=566 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/7656de428e8f31443f5e70bc70b45da1.webm?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/7656de428e8f31443f5e70bc70b45da1.mp4?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Three Phases of the day</u></strong> <br>Dawn, dusk, and night — each with its own light, mist, and drifting fireflies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/ee2713b81c4bd9095f864bcf7ae5ffd2.poster.avif?t=1787090035\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/ee2713b81c4bd9095f864bcf7ae5ffd2.webm?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/ee2713b81c4bd9095f864bcf7ae5ffd2.mp4?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Co-working companion</u></strong><br>Put the island anywhere on your screen and resize it to fit. No timers, no notifications. A little to do if you want it, nothing asked of you if you don't. Dusky enjoys the company in any setting you want him!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/419db74240598e735ea24c3b38002a86.poster.avif?t=1787090035\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/419db74240598e735ea24c3b38002a86.webm?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/419db74240598e735ea24c3b38002a86.mp4?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Reach level 30 and new friends come to stay.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Free content updates after launch*</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dusky's Nook is a cozy idle desktop game about a little mushroom guy living his life on a floating island.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gather mushrooms</u></strong><br>Dusky spends his days foraging on his own. Rare glowing mushrooms appear now and then — those ones only you can collect, for a big EXP boost.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/86f6d4e393fce34c9d85e74a150df7de.poster.avif?t=1787090035\" width=556 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/86f6d4e393fce34c9d85e74a150df7de.webm?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/86f6d4e393fce34c9d85e74a150df7de.mp4?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Make the island yours</u></strong><br>Level up to unlock new looks for Dusky and his island, light phases, the palette, the music, a few extra animations, and maybe even some new companions..</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/7656de428e8f31443f5e70bc70b45da1.poster.avif?t=1787090035\" width=566 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/7656de428e8f31443f5e70bc70b45da1.webm?t=1787090035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5019070/extras/7656de428e8f31443f5e70bc70b45da1.mp4?t=1787090035\